<BaseLayout title="About Fiero — Fiero Consulting" description="Fiero is a specialist identity and automation consulting practice focused on senior, hands-on architecture and implementation.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap" data-reveal><div class="eyebrow">About Fiero</div><h1>Specialist by design.</h1><p>Fiero is a small identity and automation consulting practice built for work where architecture, integration and operational detail all matter.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap content-grid"><aside><div class="sidebar-label">How we work</div></aside><div class="prose" data-reveal><h2>Senior expertise stays close to the work.</h2><p>Fiero is intentionally positioned between a solo freelancer model and a large systems integrator. Engagements are specialist, technical and hands-on, with less distance between architecture decisions and implementation reality.</p><h3>Identity first</h3><p>Work is grounded in practical IAM: Okta Workforce Identity, Microsoft Entra, HR-driven lifecycle, SSO, provisioning, governance, automation and the operational cleanup that keeps those systems usable.</p><h3>Emerging agent identity</h3><p>Fiero is extending that identity discipline into the emerging agentic enterprise: delegated authorization, non-human identity, MCP/XAA patterns, governance and cross-system automation.</p><h3>Built to leave systems better</h3><p>The goal is not permanent dependency. Good engagements simplify the environment, automate repeatable work, improve documentation and leave an internal team with a clearer operating model.</p></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
